    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Before loading your vehicle, conduct a thorough digital audit to document its current condition, capturing images and videos of every aspect of the car. This detailed documentation will serve as a reference point for comparing the condition of the vehicle after the transport.</p>
